## 📈 Improvements & Suggestions

### Training Pipeline (Highest Priority)

| Issue | Fix |
|-------|-----|
| No train/val split | Use `data.skip(N)` for training |
| Double normalization | Use `preprocess_input()` |
| No Dropout | Add `Dropout(0.3)` before final Dense |
| No EarlyStopping | Add `EarlyStopping(patience=5)` |
| No LR scheduling | Add `ReduceLROnPlateau(patience=3)` |
| No runtime augmentation | Add `RandomFlip`, `RandomRotation` layers |
| Frozen base forever | Unfreeze top 30 layers after initial training |
| Only 10 epochs | Use 50 epochs with EarlyStopping |

### Data Pipeline

| Issue | Fix |
|-------|-----|
| Augmented data in source dir | Clean originals, save augmentations to `result/` |
| No `result/` directory | Fix augmentation notebook to create it |
| Global variable misuse | Make `image_list` a local variable inside function |

### Security

| Issue | Fix |
|-------|-----|
| Plaintext passwords | Use `bcrypt.hashpw()` |
| Hardcoded secret key | Use `os.environ["SECRET_KEY"]` |
| No CSRF | Add Flask-WTF CSRF protection |

### Prediction Module

| Issue | Fix |
|-------|-----|
| Model naming | Rename [.h5](file:///home/tej/code/tobacco/Copy%20of%20Integration%20of%20Traditional%20Knowledge%20and%20Modern%20Science/Integration%20of%20Traditional%20Knowledge%20and%20Modern%20Science/Integration%20of%20Traditional%20Knowledge%20M3/model/model_inceptionv2_withaug500.h5) files from `inceptionv2` to `mobilenetv2` |
| Normalization mismatch | [prediction.py](file:///home/tej/code/tobacco/Copy%20of%20Integration%20of%20Traditional%20Knowledge%20and%20Modern%20Science/Integration%20of%20Traditional%20Knowledge%20and%20Modern%20Science/03_web_app/prediction.py) normalizes to [0,1] but model was trained on [0,1] too (due to the training bug), so it's "consistent" right now. When you fix training, also fix prediction to use `preprocess_input()` |

