[model_training_v2.py](file:///home/tej/code/tobacco/Copy%20of%20Integration%20of%20Traditional%20Knowledge%20and%20Modern%20Science/Integration%20of%20Traditional%20Knowledge%20and%20Modern%20Science/02_model_training/model_training_v2.py)

### How to Run Training

```bash
# 1. Activate the Python 3.11 venv
cd 01_data_augmentation && source venv/bin/activate

# 2. First, clean the augmented images from the source dataset
cd ../01_data_augmentation/Medicinal_Leaves
find . -name "aug_*" -delete  # Remove the 4430 contaminating augmented files

# 3. Re-run augmentation to generate clean result/ directory
# (Or use the original Medicinal_Leaves if you have enough data)

# 4. Run the improved training script
cd ../../02_model_training
python model_training_v2.py

# Training will print epoch-by-epoch metrics.
# It will auto-stop when validation loss stops improving.
# Final model saved as: models/mobilenetv2_leaf_classifier.h5
```

> [!IMPORTANT]
> Training will take time. Run it, observe the training/validation accuracy curves printed at the end, and share the results with me. If overfitting is confirmed (training acc >> validation acc), we'll add more regularization.
